    "created_at": "2026-03-16T15:05:32Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-16T15:05:32Z",
    "body": "This is only for non-intercepted fragment navigations, right?\nWith intercepted navigations, it makes sense that `stop` and `open` would abort the async interception state.\nBut when it's not intercepted, everything is synchronous anyway.\nAm I missing somtehing?",
